SUMMARY: Abstract Watercolor painting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Abstract Watercolor Painting at Riley Street\, Sa
 nta Rosa\n\nInstructor: Anne Millett\n\nTuesday\, June 23rd\n\n11:00AM-2:
 00PM\n\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nThere will be over 70 high quality paint colors 
 for you to choose from\, plus 6 metallics. You will spend time selecting 
 your colors intuitively\, for the way they make you feel in the moment. T
 his process is quite personal.\n\nWhat we paint does not need to accurate
 ly represent real things that we see in the "outside world". We listen to
  our intuitions as our paintings build shape by shape\, mark by mark\, wi
 thout planning the end result. We paint simply and methodically\, focusin
 g on putting paint on paper and seeing what happens\, then where we'll go
  next.\n\nHigh quality watercolor paint\, very good brushes\, 1 piece of 
 Arches 140# cold press watercolor paper (and a second if you finish your 
 first painting)\, and complete set-ups for painting in class will be prov
 ided.\n\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+\n\nall levels of experie
 nce welcome\n\nclass sizes are limited to 8 people\, please register earl
 y\n\nEmail the instructor\, Anne Millett\, for registration and payment d
 etails: mailto:classes@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com mailto:
 classes@miraaster.com\n\nclasses@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.c
 om
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
