SUMMARY: Pilot Parallel Pen Demonstration: Doodles to Cadels
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Juanita Watkins\nThursdays\, Ongoing\n4:30PM-5:30
 PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree!\n\n\n\nGet HANDS-ON with local a
 rtist and calligrapher Juanita Watkins as she demonstrates the expressive
  power of Pilot Parallel Pens.\n\nThis fun\, beginner oriented demonstrat
 ion will help you discover the connection between doodling and calligraph
 y. Juanita will show how creating simple repetitive shapes can transform 
 into beautiful calligraphy.\n\nExperiment with multicolored lettering\, e
 xplore shimmering gold effects with Finetec colors\, and learn how to pus
 h your tools further—like using a Parallel Pen with a pointed dip pen for
  fine detail work and other effects.\n\nAlong the way\, Juanita will cove
 r ink behavior\, alternative ink options\, cleaning techniques for Parall
 el Pens\, and introduce you to Cadel lettering.\n\nDid we mention that th
 is is hands on and free? Sign up soon!\n\n\n\n
