  year — and you're invited to be part of the creativity and magic.\n\nThi
 s FREE\, family-friendly event is for everyone — artists\, creatives\, cr
 afters\, curious minds\, and anyone who just loves to make things. With 3
 0+ inspiring artists and demonstrators joining us\, you'll get hands-on w
 ith a wide range of mediums\, styles\, and techniques — from painting and
  drawing to printmaking\, collage\, mixed media\, and more.\n\n✨ Make & T
 ake art stations\n🎨 Live demos all day\n🖌 Meet the brand representative
 s\n🖋️Local Artist Groups and Organizations\n\nWhether you're picking up 
 a brush for the first time or you've got paint in your veins\, this is yo
 ur chance to try something new\, talk shop with working artists\, instruc
 tors\, local arts organizations and walk away with your very own creation
 s.\n\nCome for the art. Stay for the inspiration. Leave with a spark.
