SUMMARY: Reserved Seat Demonstration: Daniel Smith Watercolor Sticks
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Scott Stevenson\nDate: Saturday\, June 27th\nTime:
  4:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFree!\n\n\nJoin Scott Stevens
 on for this very informative demonstration revealing the power of pure pi
 gment at your fingertips! Learn about the portable\, versatile watercolor
  stick. Painting\, drawing\, scribbling and mark-making come together for
  maximum creative expression. Each stick is the equivalent of three full 
 pans of paint\, making it a fantastic value.\n\nEasily carry\, store and 
 protect your Daniel Smith Watercolor Sticks with a 5-compartment\, transl
 ucent plastic case with a snap lid. Break the compartments apart to carry
  individual sticks or leave attached to keep your favorite colors togethe
 r. Perfect for storing many other types of creative mark-making tools as 
 well.\n\nThis demonstration is limited to 25 attendees.\n\nRSVP for a spo
 t!
