SUMMARY: Drawing Fundamentals
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Elysia Rose Cordero\nDate: Sunday\, July 5th\nTim
 e: 1:00PM-3:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45\n\n\nThis class pr
 ovides a foundational introduction to the art of drawing\, designed for a
 bsolute beginners or those with experience. The session focuses on bridgi
 ng the gap between seeing and recreating form on paper. Key areas of focu
 s include:\n\n  * Supply Essentials: A comprehensive look at the specific
  materials required for drawing\, including the differences between penci
 l grades (H vs. B) and eraser types.\n  * Proper Technique: Guidance on h
 ow to properly hold and use drawing supplies to achieve varying line weig
 hts and textures while maintaining control.\n  * The Artist’s Eye: Exerci
 ses dedicated to improving hand-eye coordination and observational skills
 \, teaching students to draw what they actually see rather than what they
  think they see.\n\n\nTeacher contact: Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com mail
 to:Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com\n\nCourse fee: $45 You are welcome to br
 ing your own supplies or send the teacher an email to have supplies provi
 ded at an additional fee.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Drawing
