SUMMARY: DEMONSTRATION: PAINTING AN OIL PORTRAIT IN LAYERS
DESCRIPTION:DEMONSTRATION: PAINTING AN OIL PORTRAIT IN LAYERS\n\nPresente
 r: Maggie Parr\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\n\nTime: 12-2 PM\n\nLoc
 ation: San Rafael store\n\nFREE SIGN-UP\n\n\nPainting a portrait in oil i
 s much easier than you think! Using a four-step process\, former Disney I
 magineer Maggie Parr will demonstrate how to create a beautiful painting 
 that looks three-dimensional\, colorful\, and alive. All levels welcome.\
 n\n\nMaggie Parr started her career as a show designer at Walt Disney Ima
 gineering\, where she designed theme park attractions around the world. S
 he also expanded into book illustration\, murals\, portraits\, comics\, a
 nd eventually\, writing books and scripts for television. She also develo
 ped her own painting practice. To that end\, she studied with master teac
 hers like Steve Huston\, Jeremy Lipking\, and Joseph Q. Daily. She got an
  MFA and taught at the college level\, then developed her own teaching me
 thods for private and group study. Today\, Maggie maintains a thriving bu
 siness creating custom art and designs for corporations\, individuals\, a
 nd non-profits. She teaches other artists to utilize classical rendering 
 techniques so they can confidently break the rules in the service of thei
 r own work. And she coaches creatives in search of deeper authenticity\, 
 healing\, and self-actualization.\n\nhttps://maggieparr.com
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Oil-Paint,Free-Demo
