SUMMARY: Drawing Fundamentals
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Elysia Rose Cordero\nDate: Sunday\, July 19th\nTi
 me: 2:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45\n\n\nThis class p
 rovides a foundational introduction to the art of drawing\, designed for 
 absolute beginners or those with experience. The session focuses on bridg
 ing the gap between seeing and recreating form on paper. Key areas of foc
 us include:\n\n  * Supply Essentials: A comprehensive look at the specifi
 c materials required for drawing\, including the differences between penc
 il grades (H vs. B) and eraser types.\n  * Proper Technique: Guidance on 
 how to properly hold and use drawing supplies to achieve varying line wei
 ghts and textures while maintaining control.\n  * The Artist’s Eye: Exerc
 ises dedicated to improving hand-eye coordination and observational skill
 s\, teaching students to draw what they actually see rather than what the
 y think they see.\n\n\nTeacher contact: Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com mai
 lto:Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com\n\nCourse fee: $45 You are welcome to b
 ring your own supplies or send the teacher an email to have supplies prov
 ided at an additional fee.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Drawing
