SUMMARY: Free Hands on Mono Printing Demo exploring The Art of Still Life
 .
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDate: Friday\, July 24th\n\nTime:
  2:30PM-4:30PM\n\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n\nLimit 8 participants\n\nF
 REE!\n\n\n\nExplore the art of still life through the process of monoprin
 ting\, using acrylic paint on Bristol paper to create a one of a kind\, s
 till life image. We will learn the process of print making using the meth
 od of direct painting and the techniques of layering paint to print a mon
 o print image.\n\nParticipants will leave with a series of still life ima
 ges and a clear understanding of the process of Mono printing.\n\nThis is
  a hands on demonstration and space is limited.\n\nRSVP to reserve your s
 pot today!
