SUMMARY: Sunlit Florals Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Susan Sweet\nJuly 25th\, 2026\n10:00AM - 4:00PM\n
 Location: Santa Rosa Store\n$95 per class\n\nJoin Susan Sweet for an insp
 iring day of watercolors! Beginning to advanced students welcome.\n\nDuri
 ng this workshop students will learn the importance of good art materials
 \, brushes\, paints\, and paper. Composition/cropping: Understanding form
  and light source. How to transfer designs to watercolor paper. Technique
 s and tricks with masking fluid to obtain soft and crisp edges and textur
 es.\n\nStudents will explore basic watercolor washes & glazing techniques
  for depth and luminosity (what paints play well with others). We will al
 so explore techniques for creating texture with spraying\, salt\, thirsty
  brush\, etc.\n\nEach student will be given two images of the piece to be
  painted\, one color and one black and white for a value study. The image
  will be transferred to the watercolor paper using graphite paper\, and m
 asking fluid applied where needed. While the fluid dries we will explore 
 painting simpler forms to practice graded washes and color combinations t
 o be used in the final painting. Students will observe demos as we move t
 hrough the painting and will receive one on one helpful guidance to gain 
 skill and confidence!\n\nSusan Sweet is a local mixed media and watercolo
 r artist whose work is inspired by nature.\n\nTo register\, please contac
 t Susan Sweet by email: mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.com mailto:susanswe
 etartist@gmail.com mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.com mailto:susansweetart
 ist@gmail.com susansweetartist@gmail.com mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.co
 m or by phone (707) 367-0672.\n\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
