SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Chamomile Flowers Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nSaturday\, August 1st\n11:00AM 
 - 2:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$50\n\n\nJoin us to unlock your inn
 er florist and create stunning crepe paper flowers.\n\nAll of us love to 
 receive flowers but we hate to see them go. Join me while I instruct you 
 to construct realistic crepe paper Chamomile flowers. Make these elegant 
 flowers for someone special or as a treat for yourself. Each petal and le
 af are hand cut from artisanal Italian crepe paper and then assembled by 
 hand.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creative atmosphere as you learn to create y
 our own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly class is designed to open up 
 your imagination by learning basic techniques when using crepe paper as t
 he flower composition. All necessary supplies and tools will be provided.
  Just bring your inspired-artful love of flowers. Participants will take 
 home their finished bouquets.\n\nTo register: please email mailto:Crawfor
 dsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com Crawfordsusan00@gmail
 .com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Crepe-Paper-Flowers
