SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nThis is a 6-class series\, meetin
 g 6 Tuesdays July 7th\,14th\,21st\,28th\, August 4th &11th.\n\n10:30AM-1:
 00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\nThere will be a materials fe
 e of $15 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced
  separately\, August 18th and 25th.\n\n\nWatercolor Fundamentals - Part 1
 \n\nThis class focuses on the simple delight of mixing color with water\,
  brushing it on paper\, and watching what happens as it moves and dries. 
 You will learn easy ways to create paintings that are all about color and
  the sometimes unpredictable nature of water.\n\nNo drawing skills are ne
 eded.\n\nIn this class we will explore the basic principles of watercolor
  painting. Learn or refresh your understanding of brush handling\, brush 
 care and setting up\, the benefits of “good paper”\, watercolor lights an
 d darks\, flat and graded washes\, wet-on-wet techniques such as charging
 \, wet-on-dry techniques such as glazing\, color wheel\, color theory\, c
 olor mixing\, and more. Simple applications of these techniques invite yo
 u to experiment and play.\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+ (excep
 tions made for very motivated teens\, please email to discuss)\n\nclass s
 izes are limited to 8 people\, please register early\n\n$270 for 6 classe
 s\, 2.5 hours each class\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 plus tax
  for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced separately\nPaya
 ble via check\, cash\, or Zelle.\n\n*Brushes\, palettes\, set-ups\, and p
 aint will be provided.*\n\n\nTo see Anne's work and to learn more about t
 his class\, please visit her website at: www.miraaster.com http://www.mir
 aaster.com/\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Anne by e
 mail at: classes@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
