SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: This is a 6-class series\,
  meeting 6 Fridays: August 7th\,14th\, 21st\, 28th\, September 4th &11th.
 \n\nTime: 2:30pm - 4:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa Store\n\nFee: $310 fo
 r 6 classes. Please check with instructor for details.\n\n\n\nThis class 
 is for art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a still life is about wak
 ing up your observational skills. Moving through different mediums\, we w
 ill embark on a journey together\, exploring how to apply many art forms 
 and techniques to express what you see in life.\n\nIn this six week cours
 e\, each class will explore a different art medium. We will draw and pain
 t with graphite\, watercolor pencils and acrylic. We will expand on those
  mediums as we move into printmaking\, collage\, and mosaic to bring your
  art to life. It's a great class to learn the fundamentals for beginners 
 and for experienced artists that want to try their hand at a new art form
  you haven't done before.\n\nAll levels Welcomed.\n\nLet's explore the be
 autiful art of expressing Art together.\n\n\nTo register for this series\
 , please contact Sandra Novia at: (707) 433-ARTS (2787)\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Mixed-Media
