SUMMARY: Drawing Fundamentals
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Elysia Rose Cordero\nDate: Sunday\, August 30th\n
 Time: 2:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45\n\n\nThis class
  provides a foundational introduction to the art of drawing\, designed fo
 r absolute beginners or those with experience. The session focuses on bri
 dging the gap between seeing and recreating form on paper. Key areas of f
 ocus include:\n\n  * Supply Essentials: A comprehensive look at the speci
 fic materials required for drawing\, including the differences between pe
 ncil grades (H vs. B) and eraser types.\n  * Proper Technique: Guidance o
 n how to properly hold and use drawing supplies to achieve varying line w
 eights and textures while maintaining control.\n  * The Artist’s Eye: Exe
 rcises dedicated to improving hand-eye coordination and observational ski
 lls\, teaching students to draw what they actually see rather than what t
 hey think they see.\n\n\nTeacher contact: Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com m
 ailto:Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com\n\nCourse fee: $45 You are welcome to
  bring your own supplies or send the teacher an email to have supplies pr
 ovided at an additional fee.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Drawing
