SUMMARY: Drawing Fundamentals
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Elysia Rose Cordero\nDate: Sunday\, September 13t
 h\nTime: 2:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45\n\n\nThis cl
 ass provides a foundational introduction to the art of drawing\, designed
  for absolute beginners or those with experience. The session focuses on 
 bridging the gap between seeing and recreating form on paper. Key areas o
 f focus include:\n\n  * Supply Essentials: A comprehensive look at the sp
 ecific materials required for drawing\, including the differences between
  pencil grades (H vs. B) and eraser types.\n  * Proper Technique: Guidanc
 e on how to properly hold and use drawing supplies to achieve varying lin
 e weights and textures while maintaining control.\n  * The Artist’s Eye: 
 Exercises dedicated to improving hand-eye coordination and observational 
 skills\, teaching students to draw what they actually see rather than wha
 t they think they see.\n\n\nTeacher contact: Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.co
 m mailto:Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com\n\nCourse fee: $45 You are welcome
  to bring your own supplies or send the teacher an email to have supplies
  provided at an additional fee.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Drawing
