SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nDate: Saturday\, October 24th\nTime:
  2:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree: $40.00\n\nThis is a 
 hands-on make and take class where you will make at least five items incl
 uding a bookmark\, a greeting card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The
  class will use two different techniques and Jan will explain how to pres
 s flowers and which flowers hold their color best. It is a creative exper
 ience!\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: mailto
 :freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mail
 to:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed 
 flowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art 
 training. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\,
  each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the
  dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes 
 and trays of flowers. She buys card stock by the thousand and picks bloom
 s from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me sayin
 g\, “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt i
 s a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in 
 the East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciat
 e it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
