 r experienced students how to master painting in Acrylics. Students are g
 iven a wealth of information regarding acrylic supplies and materials for
  painting realism or abstraction. At each class\, Hines will assist each 
 student in the execution and completion of their painting. Including inst
 ructions and demonstrations on color\, paint application\, color mixing\,
  form and composition. This is a great opportunity for anyone wishing to 
 learn how to paint with acrylics as well as oil painters wishing to trans
 ition from oils to acrylics.\n\nFee:\n\nSign up for 4 classes: $200 (limi
 ted to 10 students)\n\nLimited Drop-ins: $60 per class\n\nTo register con
 tact Hines at: mailto:TheArtistHines@gmail.com TheArtistHines@gmail.com m
